  "design_notes_md": "# \ud83c\udfa8 Design Notes \u2014 Studio Freight\n\n> **URL:** https://studiofreight.com/  \n> **Style:** modern professional  \n> **Premium Score:** 56/100 (\ud83d\udc4d Above Average)\n\n## Quick Profile\n\n| Trait | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Mood | polished competence |\n| Era | contemporary |\n| Contrast | high-contrast |\n| Whitespace | generous |\n| Complexity | moderate |\n| Density | balanced (51/100) |\n| Whitespace Ratio | 0.804 |\n\n## Typography & Colour\n\n- **Typography prominence:** balanced\n- **Typography pattern:** uppercase-headings\n- **Colour contrast:** high-contrast\n- \ud83c\udf11 **Dark theme** detected\n\n## Layout & Rhythm\n\n- **Hero type:** full-screen-with-image\n- **Section count:** 5\n- **Spacing rhythm:** dramatic-variation\n- **Content width:** full-width-sections\n- **Vertical rhythm:** comfortable-rhythm\n\n**Section flow:** `hero \u2192 content \u2192 footer \u2192 content`\n\n> Page flow: hero \u2192 content \u2192 footer \u2192 content. Opens with a strong hero section, presenting core content, closing with navigation and contact information, presenting core content.\n\n### Captured Sections\n\n- `hero.png` \u2014 *hero* (1440\u00d7900)\n- `section-05.png` \u2014 *section-05* (1440\u00d7900)\n\n## Navigation\n\n- **Pattern (basic):** floating-transparent\n- **Style:** sticky-solid\n- **Behaviour:** always-visible\n- **Fixed:** yes\n- **Backdrop blur:** no\n- **Shadow:** no\n- **Links:** 8\n- **Logo:** no\n\n## Animation & Motion\n\n- **Approach:** interaction-focused micro-animations\n- **Intensity:** subtle\n- **Transition style:** standard\n- **Libraries:** Lenis\n- **Techniques:** hover-micro-interactions\n\n### Timing Pattern: **none**\n\n- Animated elements: 0\n- Elements with delay: 0\n\n## \ud83d\uddb1 Interaction Capture\n\n- **Interactive elements detected:** 3\n- **Element types:** image, nav-link\n- **Interaction types:** hover\n\n### Targets\n\n- \u25cf **nav-link-hover** \u2014 Navigation link hover (8 links) (hover)\n- \u25cb **image-hover-1** \u2014 Image hover in section 1 (hover)\n- \u25cb **image-hover-4** \u2014 Image hover in section 4 (hover)\n\n## Imagery\n\n- **Primary approach:** product-focused with high-quality renders\n- **Hero:** full-bleed-photo\n- **Background:** solid-color\n- **Icons:** minimal-or-none\n- **Density:** image-heavy\n- **Effects:** blend-modes\n\n## \ud83d\uddbc Media Intelligence\n\n- **Hero media:** text-only\n- **Media density:** media-heavy\n- **Images detected:** 26\n- **Videos detected:** 0\n- **SVGs detected:** 0\n\n### Image Roles\n\n- `content`: 25\n- `thumbnail`: 1\n\n## Premium Patterns\n\n- floating-navbar\n- full-width-sections\n- blend-mode-effects\n- generous-whitespace\n- dark-theme\n- section-dividers\n\n**CTA style:** standard\n**Footer style:** minimal-social\n\n## Key Takeaways\n\n1. Study the modern professional aesthetic approach and how it creates cohesion\n2. Replicate the interaction-focused micro-animations motion strategy\n3. Apply the product-focused with high-quality renders approach to visual content\n4. Implement the floating-transparent navigation pattern\n5. Adopt the uppercase-headings typography approach\n\n---\n\n*Generated by UX Analyzer \u2014 Design Intelligence Engine*",
